      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "notes": "Rochester cultivates the appearance of a match largely to provoke Jane; Blanche values rank and fortune.",
      "isMutual": false,
      "createdAtEventId": "jane-eyre-event-032"
    },
    {
      "worldId": "jane-eyre-world",
